{"sourceUrl":"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0720/c9297a600570/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:06.294587+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/2026/0720/c9297a600570/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span>为增进高校间优秀大学生的交流与联系，促进优秀本科生对南开大学材料学科的了解与体验，我院将于</span><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>07</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>24</span><span>日全天举办“南开大学材料科学与工程学院</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营”。</span></span></p><p><span>学院所有专业均接受报名，营员可根据兴趣和发展方向选择研究方向，欢迎全国各高校优秀学子踊跃报名</span><span>!</span></p><p><span>各专业方向包括：</span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>直博：</span></span><span><span>080501</span><span>材料物理与化学（学术学位）、</span></span><span><span>080502</span><span>材料学（学术学位）、</span></span><span><span>085601</span><span>材料工程（专业学位）</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>学硕：</span></span><span><span>080501</span><span>材料物理与化学、</span></span><span><span>080502</span><span>材料学</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>专硕：</span></span><span><span>085601</span><span>材料工程</span></span></p><p><span><strong>一、报名条件</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>热爱祖国、遵纪守法、诚实守信、品德良好、身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.2027</span><span>年应届本科毕业生，本科期间学习成绩优秀；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>对材料、化学、物理等相关学科的科研工作抱有浓厚兴趣，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业发展潜力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><span>英语成绩须符合以下任一项要求：</span><span></span></span></p><p><span>全国大学英语六级考试成绩、全国大学英语四级考试成绩、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>成绩、</span><span>IELTS</span><span>（</span><span>A</span><span>类</span><span>/</span><span>学术类）成绩、</span><span>GRE</span><span>成绩、</span><span>GMAT</span><span>成绩均为良好，英语专业四级（及以上）考试合格。</span></p><p><span><strong>二、报名方式及流程</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>网上报名</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>扫描下方二维码（</span><span><strong>下方图片</strong></span><span>）打开报名链接：</span></span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/46/99/9616680844698f03f6b331031135/41365021-5a3e-4696-957d-b90b1a0f6c05.png\"/></p><p><span>请成功入营的同学将以下材料电子版发送至邮箱</span><span><span>mater@nankai.edu.cn</span><span>：</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>1</span><span>）本科成绩单和专业排名证明（需加盖学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span><span>）国家英语四级、六级考试成绩单复印件或</span></span><span><span>TOEFL/GRE/</span><span>雅思成绩等体现自身英语水平的证明；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span><span>）专家推荐信两封，需有专家亲笔签字（模板见附件）；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span><span>）个人陈述（模版见附件）；</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>5</span><span>）其他证明材料（可选），包括：获奖证书复印件；本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性成果等。</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>6</span><span>）个人展示照片</span></span><span><span>/</span><span>视频（可选）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>请准备以上材料电子版或扫描件（务必保证清晰可见），并按上述顺序整理</strong></span><span><strong>扫描后合成一个</strong></span></span></span><span><span><strong>PDF</strong></span><span><strong>文件</strong></span><span><strong>（</strong></span><span><strong>限</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>10</strong></span><span><strong>页以内</strong></span><span><strong>）</strong></span><span><strong>，命名为“</strong></span><span><strong>夏令营材料—报考专业</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span><span><strong>就读学校</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span><span><strong>姓名</strong></span><span><strong>”发送至邮箱</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>mater@nankai.edu.cn</strong></span><span><strong>，邮件题目为：</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>2026</strong></span><span><strong>南开材料夏令营</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span><span><strong>就读学校</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span><span><strong>姓名</strong></span><span><strong>。</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>报名时间</span></span></p><p><span>即日起至</span><span><span>07</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>22</span><span>日周三上午</span></span><span><span>10</span><span>：</span></span><span><span>00</span><span>之前。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>选拔营员和确认参营</span></span></p><p><span>我院将组织专家审核组对报名材料进行审核和筛选，请完成问卷星填报确认能来材料学院的同学于</span><strong><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span>07</span></span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>24</span></span><span>日周五上午</span></span><span>11:30</span><span><span><span>之前</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span></span><span>到南开大学材料科学与工程学院（津南校区）现场进行报到，</span><span>入营的同学请及时加入飞书群，请注意后续材料学院官网通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong>三、活动安排</strong></span></p><p><span>夏令营活动时间：</span><span><span>07</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>24</span><span>日全天（上午</span></span><span><strong>09:00</strong></span><span><strong>～</strong></span><span><strong>11:30</strong></span><span>入营报到），中午</span><span><strong>12:00</strong></span><span><strong>～</strong></span><span><strong>12:45</strong></span><span>用午餐（学院负责）。</span></p><p><span><strong>13:00</strong></span><span><strong>～</strong></span><span><strong>14:30</strong></span><span>到材料学院</span><span><span>142</span><span>多功能厅参加材料学院</span></span><span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营开幕式（院领导致欢迎词、材料学院介绍、六大中心分别介绍）。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>14:30</strong></span><span><strong>～</strong></span><span><strong>15:00</strong></span><span>参观学院国家级重点实验室及大型仪器平台。</span></p><p><span><strong>15:00</strong></span><span><strong>～</strong></span><span><strong>17:00</strong></span><span>学生根据问卷星填报的中心（最多</span><span><span>3</span><span>个）进行</span><span>营员个人展示活动。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>17:30</span></strong></span><span>本届夏令营活动结束，入营同学可自行选择离校。</span></p><p><span><strong>四、营员待遇</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span></span><span>为全体营员准备午餐工作餐。</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span></span><span>为全体营员购买夏令营活动期间的意外保险。</span></p><p><span>营员报到后需要全程参加活动，严禁擅自离营。</span></p><p><span><strong>四、联系方式</strong></span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>022-23502604</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>mater@nankai.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>以上内容如有变动，以最新通知为准。</span></p><p><span>请随时关注学院招生主页：</span><span><span><a href=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/9297/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/9297/list.htm</a></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/46/99/9616680844698f03f6b331031135/6823499e-0016-4f84-a6e0-3880576e43bb.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">模板：个人陈述.docx</a></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://mse.nankai.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/46/99/9616680844698f03f6b331031135/155c1221-caba-4a7c-9b55-fc18ba740816.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">模板：专家推荐函.docx</a></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"637cd2d0f595c2fca2fcf0d3bd84a1decbf8711541d564ca3206245557eef1c8","textLength":1433,"sourceSha256":"e41e19c95badecbef1f68aa8cb4085653cdbbaff2020f82c7e60d7e5f19557d9","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-dbef8eb37b412c78a22f","title":"2026年南开大学材料科学与工程学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:06.294587+00:00"}
